With a new CTM dataset,  

  Check with ctm_plotting
    - drop the data.nc into example directory
    - ask contributor (Terry Lee) for reference call and csv reference files
    - create a test script base from one of the r_sample 
    - run and verify the result matches with csv reference files

  Work into CTM explorer (CTM_web)
    - put datafile into CTM_DATASET_DIRECTORY  (on moho, at /var/www/html)
           model/newmodel/datafile.nc
    - change owner/group to apache

    - add model information into web/js/ctm_region.js

Currently, postgres db is not being used but can potentially be used to store
the metadata in ctm_region.js

